# The machine, as this Lima guest reaches it (read by cseries-machine-firewall).
# The cseries command rewrites this file on every run, adding the machine's
# own addresses; until then it holds Lima's user-mode network, where
# 192.168.5.2 is the machine's own loopback and 192.168.5.3 its DNS.
block 192.168.5.0/24
dns 192.168.5.3
